 great importance. Turin (}{\i\f211 The Augustan Taurinians}{\f208 ) against Grenoble (}{\i\f211 the Gratianopolitans}{\f208 ). What do you think about this?\par 3.\emdash  Nothing! Moreover I didn't know such a match was going to take place (}{\i\f211 going-to-be to-be I-ignored}{\f208 ). What game are we talking about (}{\i\f211 about what game is-discussed}{\f208 )?\par 4.\emdash  It's unbelievable! Don't you know [that] the teams of both cities [excel in] (}{\i\f211 to excel by}{\f208 ) [football] (}{\i\f211 round ball}{\f208 )? The outcome will be uncertain (}{\i\f211 two-headed}{\f208 ).\par 5.\emdash  I knew nothing of these things. To watch a game [of football or of rugby] (}{\i\f211 of round or oval ball}{\f208 ) does not displease me. But I can surmise nothing about the outcome of this contest.\par 6.\emdash  If you wish to see the contest and know the outcome immediately, come with me!\par 7.\emdash  Thanks! It's impossible. Today I must go fishing with Stephen. I can't let him down (}{\i\f211 be-missing}{\f208 /}{\i\f211 lacking to-him}{\f208 ).\par 8.\emdash  You prefer quiet pastimes to athletics. Isn't it true?\par 9.\emdash  Not at all! You will be sitting during the whole afternoon. We on the other hand will trudge (}{\i\f211 run through}{\f208 ) ten miles along the torrent in the mountains to catch trout, and\u8230\'c9\par 10. perhaps we will return home without any fish.\par 11.\emdash  So that you are not told off by your wife, remember this: fish shops are not lacking in our city.\par \par NOTES\par }{\b\f210 1. M}{\f208 a}{\b\f210 gni mom}{\f208 e}{\b\f210 nti}{\f208 : these two words are a complement (possessive phrase) of the noun }{\b\f210 cert}{\f208 a}{\b\f210 men}{\f208 , -}{\b\f210 inis}{\f208 , n., }{\i\f211 fight,}{\f208  }{\i\f211 competition}{\f208 , }{\i\f211 match}{\f208 . This complement is often in the the genitive, which otherwise matches the English constuction, but it can also be in the ablative (vid. L 25: }{\b\f